  m_text: '<b>Description:</b>

    What if the barriers and trash containers were
    removed? What happens to the river and its ecosystem?


    <b>Player Actions:</b>

    1.
    Pull the lever to remove the barriers.

    2. Use the camera to look into the
    polluted future.'
