  m_text: "<b>Description:</b>\r\nA factory currently stands outside the city. What
    if it was moved into the city and its production was increased? How would it
    affect the citizens\u2019 health and the environment?\n\n<b>Player Actions:</b>\r\n1.
    Use the lever to move the factory into the city.\r\n2. Use the camera to view
    the smog-filled future.\r\n3. Control time to see how smog spreads."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
