  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Description:</b>

    What if we replace traditional lanterns with
    LED ones? How will this affect insects, plants, and the ecosystem?


    <b>Player
    Actions:</b>

    1. Pull the lever to switch normal lanterns to LED.

    2.
    Use the camera to view the future consequences.

    3. Adjust time (day/night)
    to see changes in different conditions.'
